notes.content:
As promised, the launch patch!!!


We fixed several bugs, most of them possible softlocks that may or may not occur during the game:


Bug that prevented progress on Map 2-5;

Bug that made parkour difficult on Map 2-4;

Dodge now has a 0.25 second cooldown before being able to roll again;

Improved respawn system for when the player falls down a hole (all stages);

Improved Elevator on stage 4-4;

Improved boss fights. These are just a few examples, among many other improvements.


Use the community to report bugs, the most serious ones can be fixed the same day!


Thank you for your patience and trust!

Reality Rash will be available for purchase here on Steam at the June 19th! And to ensure that your journey fighting through multiple realities is the best possible, we have been working on several optimizations over the last few months:


 We have made the game available in new languages;
 We have introduced cheat codes;
 We have added achievements for players;
 We have balanced enemy stats;
 Another round of testing to identify and fix bugs;
 General improvements to the user experience; 


We are very excited to fully present this game to the world, which is so dear to us, the developers at Give your jumps studio, that we have been working on it for the last few years, correcting, redoing, polishing and refining it until we get the best result.

We hope that you can have as much fun as possible on this extradimensional journey and, if we are successful in this goal, we would greatly appreciate it if you could leave a positive review.
Many thanks to everyone who has followed our development journey thus far. Now you better hurry, because Cyrus awaits in the dark depths of the Pasargada Corporation!

• Performance optimization, running the game faster;
    • New combos;
    • New fighting animations;
    • Added character illustrations during in-game dialogues;
    • Corrections of errors found during testing;

The release date is approaching, so keep an eye on our page so you don't miss any news!
